title: "Bayanat Labs open policies"
abstract: "The rules Bayanat Labs follows when it chooses, licenses and publishes open Arabic data: the open-programme policy (selection rubric, release tiers, licence matrix), the gated operating manual for building open datasets, and the bl-score scoring tool. English and Arabic. Documentation, not legal advice."
